<DT><a href="./readres.cgi?bo=sika&vi=983842118&res=2&fi=no" target="_new">2</a>　 <B>imadak</B>　 2001/03/06(Tue) 10:29<BR>
<DD>*8th Ring取得の時の言葉<BR>[Thu Feb 22 03:11:08 2001] Garadain Glacierbane says 'Good work friend! The Dain will hear of this right away. We couldn't have defeated the Ry'gorr without your help. Take this ring as proof that you have served the Coldain well. You may wish to show it to the Seneschal should you ever stop in our fine city. Farewell, Higashinoko , it has been my pleasure knowing you. <BR>[Thu Feb 22 03:11:08 2001] You gain party experience!!<BR><BR>------icewell keep-------<BR>*Dainの隣にいるSeneschal AldikarにRingを渡す<BR><BR>[Sun Jan 02 05:46:25 2000] Seneschal Aldikar says 'Well done, Imadak , I have heard of your victory over the Ry`Gorr. If you are willing to assist the crown further please follow me. <BR><BR>[Sun Jan 02 05:47:21 2000] Seneschal Aldikar says 'Please, shut the door behind you. What I am about to share with you must not be overheard. <BR><BR>[Sun Jan 02 05:47:37 2000] Seneschal Aldikar says 'My army stands prepared to launch an assault on Kael itself, but one task must be completed before this can happen. <BR><BR>[Sun Jan 02 05:47:57 2000] Seneschal Aldikar says 'It seems Rodrick was not alone in his treachery. There is a faction of Coldain who believe that a treaty should be signed with the Kromrif, ending our hostilities with them. This, of course, is impossible. If there is one thing our history here has taught us it is that the Kromrif simply cannot be trusted. <BR><BR>[Sun Jan 02 05:48:07 2000] Seneschal Aldikar says 'These traitors are poisoning the minds of our citizens, promising great rewards to those who will betray the Dain. It will take the unbiased eye of an outlander to flush out the masterminds behind this plan. Once again we turn to you. <BR><BR>[Sun Jan 02 05:48:17 2000] Seneschal Aldikar says 'Will you accept this task outlander? <BR><BR>[Sun Jan 02 05:48:29 2000] You say, 'i will accept this task'<BR><BR>[Sun Jan 02 05:48:29 2000] Seneschal Aldikar says 'In this box, place the accursed dirk of the fallen Rodrick. With it combine the heads of every traitor you dispose of. When this is done give the box and the velium insignia ring to the Dain directly. On behalf of the crown and all good Coldain, I thank you ... May Brell be with you. <BR><BR>*6slot box取得(ND)<BR><BR>クルクルダガーとtraitor head(5個?)をcombineしてDainにRingと一緒にわたすといいものもらえるかも！？<BR><hr>
<DT><a href="./readres.cgi?bo=sika&vi=983842118&res=3&fi=no" target="_new">3</a>　 <B>imadak</B>　 2001/03/06(Tue) 10:29<BR>
<DD>*GDにいるDwarfたち*<BR><BR>[safehouse] Davin Fatfist says 'Well, we are alive, but I'd hardly say we're well... We have heard of the death of Rodrick, and the Dain is calling on all citizens of Thurgadin to flush out any opposition to the throne. If we're tied to your dealings with the Kromrif we'll be sent to the bottom of the well for sure. <BR><BR>[Sun Feb 25 23:32:10 2001] Murdrick Tardok says 'The Dain knows nothing, and I have a plan to keep it that way. I have given the matter much thought, and I have gathered you all here to ask for your help. <BR><BR>[Sun Feb 25 23:32:22 2001] Gerton Dumkin says 'We all saw what happened when Rodrick agreed to help you. I, for one, am none too eager to take on these new friends of the Dain. <BR><BR>[Sun Feb 25 23:32:35 2001] Murdrick Tardok says 'Rodrick knew what he was getting into, and so did you. It's a bit too late for second thoughts. I don't recall seeing any hesitation when the loot was being passed around. <BR><BR>[Sun Feb 25 23:32:47 2001] Lapker Geynion says 'Go ahead Murdrick, what's this plan of yours? <BR><BR>[safehouse] Murdrick Tardok says 'As I said I've thought long and hard of our situation and I feel we are indeed in danger. My cousin Berradin is a captain in the Dain's army. I've always been uneasy about him, but now more than ever. He could easily betray many of us and take credit for destroying the rebellion. <BR><BR>[safehouse] Murdrick Tardok says 'My plan is to poison him and plant a suicide note on the body, a note in which he would take full responsibility for the actions of the rebels. This would both ensure that he could never betray us and would give the Dain closure. We will be free to continue working with our Kromrif friends without fear of discovery. <BR><BR>[safehouse] Davin Fatfist says 'Sounds good boss, but how do you plan on poisoning him? <BR><BR>[safehouse] Murdrick Tardok says 'Berradin has a weakness for drink, one drink in particular... Avalanche Ale. I have had the recipe altered slightly to include a deadly poison. I have much to do, I need one of you to brew the drink and bring it to me. I'll handle the rest. <BR><BR>[safehouse] Gerton Dumkin chuckles, 'Once again, Murdrick, you've put us at ease in the middle of a treacherous predicament. I will volunteer to brew the drink. <BR><BR>[safehouse] Murdrick Tardok smiles, 'Very well, take this recipe and follow it exactly. It won't be easy, but you'll be richly rewarded for your efforts I assure you. Send word to meet me back here when you are finished. <BR><BR>[safehouse] Gerton Dumkin says 'Consider it done. Be sure to watch yourself Murd, the Dain's gotta be suspicious of ya, being Rodrick's brother and all. And those outlander friends of his are dangerous, chopped down the Ry`Gorr chief like he was nothin!<BR>---------------------<BR>Murdrick 倒そうとしたけど、<BR>Kiting中にDepop。。まだ詳細不明<BR><BR>こいつが目的のTraitorだとおもうけど～<BR><BR>ちなみにDwarfはFac無し<BR>強制Linkで近いとWarpAdd<hr>
<DT><a href="./readres.cgi?bo=sika&vi=983842118&res=4&fi=no" target="_new">4</a>　 <B>imadak</B>　 2001/03/12(Mon) 04:59<BR>
<DD>やっぱりMurdrickは倒すらしい・・<BR>で倒すと、Headとレシピが出て、レシピには<BR>=safehouse=---------------------<BR>To make tainted avalanche ale, simply combine the following in a brewing keg:<BR>an iceball, an icewyvern stynger, artic mussels, seahorse scales, a runed sea shell, and a vial of mind melt crafted by a skilled rogue.<BR>When i offer this to berradin our worries will perish with him.<BR>Murdrick.<BR><BR>→ <a href="http://www.multimania.com/kiritin/berradinpoisonrecipe.jpg">http://www.multimania.com/kiritin/berradinpoisonrecipe.jpg</a><BR><BR>Iceball - Snow Servishes in EW/Icelcad<BR>Icewyvern stingers, Rare off wyverns in CS<BR>Artic Mussels - Foraged in CS, ground spawn in water.<BR>Seahorse Scales - common drop off Seahorses in Sirens<BR>Rune Sea Shell- ?siren drops? <BR>----------------------------------<hr>
